{"2929550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Netcode Conflict", "steam_appid": 2929550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <i><strong>'The Netcode Conflict'</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are working on an community event based futuristic multiplayer game in a big persistent Open world. Let`s start with us our development and create with us the next epic game. This Project, where gaming meets community in an unforgettable experience! We're not just about delivering fun and action-packed gameplay; we're all about tailor-making a game that speaks directly to you, our community. Together, we're crafting something truly special – a game that's not just played, but lived and cherished. Join us on this journey, and let's create gaming history together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/SnippetSteamV4.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/f336311eb93e409717317e41fd6a624c.avif?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore</i></strong> a futuristic open world to discover new areas, find items, and improve your defenses against enemies. Be Careful and Loot your Equipment to be Ready for the Battle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/Sand.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/9a5131291d163ae07f1461b6b7c42242.avif?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=200 /></span><i><strong>Advance</strong></i> through challenges, earn points and become truly epic. Team up or fight solo to take over the control point system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> against powerful AI guarding the Obelisks to claim rare Netcode Fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/ObeliskEvent.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/3201a4d959de65ba2e5c687b73ea0bd7.avif?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Survive</strong></i> to improve your skills and discover special abilities. Be the last man standing and hold the control point system to unlock special features.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find</strong> valuable loot in buildings inside and outside the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/LootFindenSca.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spice up </strong>your character with rare loot you uncover in the world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/InventoryV2.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft </strong>special items like <i>Ammo</i> and <i>Regen Units</i> to be ready for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/CraftingAmmo.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet AI-Sy</strong>, your trusted ally for locating loot, spotting enemies, and providing healing support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/HealingBot.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/fc7148dbdd9f9765a32f9f9a318e5f8f.avif?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-apocalyptic cyberpunk survival shooter, set in a world devastated by war over the &quot;Netcode,&quot; you have the choice to go solo or team up with friends. You begin randomly somewhere in the world in a landing pod and start with a unique character (Facade). At first, you start without equipment and must quickly scavenge loot. Explore the world and get into a city to capture the control point and earn points that make you unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into our world, where passion knows no bounds! Here's the kicker – we're doing all of this without a budget, pouring our hearts and souls into this project during our precious free time. Despite the lack of funds, our dedication knows no limits. So buckle up and get ready to embark on an adventure like no other, fueled purely by love for gaming and community spirit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/a689d7a00ac1d1012acc7442cca811c1.poster.avif?t=1764886238\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/a689d7a00ac1d1012acc7442cca811c1.webm?t=1764886238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/a689d7a00ac1d1012acc7442cca811c1.mp4?t=1764886238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <i><strong>'The Netcode Conflict'</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are working on an community event based futuristic multiplayer game in a big persistent Open world. Let`s start with us our development and create with us the next epic game. This Project, where gaming meets community in an unforgettable experience! We're not just about delivering fun and action-packed gameplay; we're all about tailor-making a game that speaks directly to you, our community. Together, we're crafting something truly special – a game that's not just played, but lived and cherished. Join us on this journey, and let's create gaming history together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/SnippetSteamV4.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/f336311eb93e409717317e41fd6a624c.avif?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore</i></strong> a futuristic open world to discover new areas, find items, and improve your defenses against enemies. Be Careful and Loot your Equipment to be Ready for the Battle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/Sand.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/9a5131291d163ae07f1461b6b7c42242.avif?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=200 /></span><i><strong>Advance</strong></i> through challenges, earn points and become truly epic. Team up or fight solo to take over the control point system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> against powerful AI guarding the Obelisks to claim rare Netcode Fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/ObeliskEvent.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/3201a4d959de65ba2e5c687b73ea0bd7.avif?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Survive</strong></i> to improve your skills and discover special abilities. Be the last man standing and hold the control point system to unlock special features.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find</strong> valuable loot in buildings inside and outside the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/LootFindenSca.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spice up </strong>your character with rare loot you uncover in the world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/InventoryV2.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft </strong>special items like <i>Ammo</i> and <i>Regen Units</i> to be ready for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/CraftingAmmo.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet AI-Sy</strong>, your trusted ally for locating loot, spotting enemies, and providing healing support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/HealingBot.gif?t=1764886238\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/fc7148dbdd9f9765a32f9f9a318e5f8f.avif?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-apocalyptic cyberpunk survival shooter, set in a world devastated by war over the &quot;Netcode,&quot; you have the choice to go solo or team up with friends. You begin randomly somewhere in the world in a landing pod and start with a unique character (Facade). At first, you start without equipment and must quickly scavenge loot. Explore the world and get into a city to capture the control point and earn points that make you unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into our world, where passion knows no bounds! Here's the kicker – we're doing all of this without a budget, pouring our hearts and souls into this project during our precious free time. Despite the lack of funds, our dedication knows no limits. So buckle up and get ready to embark on an adventure like no other, fueled purely by love for gaming and community spirit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/23b47a1d950d796d4c7ca1f72274126b.webp?t=1764886238\" width=600 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/a689d7a00ac1d1012acc7442cca811c1.poster.avif?t=1764886238\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/a689d7a00ac1d1012acc7442cca811c1.webm?t=1764886238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/extras/a689d7a00ac1d1012acc7442cca811c1.mp4?t=1764886238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The Netcode Conflict is a community-event-driven online multiplayer game. Our goal is to develop and improve the game together with the community. We host regular events where players can win in-game rewards. TNC is still actively in development, and your ideas and feedback help shape its future!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/header.jpg?t=1764886238", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764886238", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764886238", "website": "https://tnc-game.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core i5 (4 Kerne oder besser)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7 (6 Kerne oder besser)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 3070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versi